- 150 g mozzarella
- 200 g tomatoes
- 1 avuç basil
- 1 yemek kaşığı olive oil
- 1 çay kaşığı balsamic vinegar
- salt and pepper

METHOD:
1. Slice the tomatoes and mozzarella to the same thickness.
2. Alternate them on a plate with basil leaves between.
3. Dress with the olive oil and balsamic and season generously.',
